# Captain Mar-Vell, Space-Born: "As long as an opponent has cast a spell this turn, you may cast spells as though they had flash."
# Bot1's Ornithopters (creature spells, so sorcery speed) are refused during Bot2's upkeep on turn 2, before Bot2 has cast anything
# that turn. Bot2 then casts a Mox, which resolves, and in Bot2's second main phase Bot1 casts an Ornithopter (the permission lasts
# once it has resolved, for the rest of the turn). On turn 4 the second Ornithopter is refused in Bot2's upkeep again (a new turn),
# and cast in response to Bot2's next Mox, while it is on the stack.

[Bot1 Deck]
Captain Mar-Vell, Space-Born
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Island x20

